      "body": "Hi Angelo,\n\nFollowing the article I sent about recurring document work, I wanted to share a related point: a faster individual task isn't the same as a better firm-wide process.\n\nThis new piece looks at how teams turn AI experiments into shared routines, with clear responsibility for review and corrections. That's increasingly the focus of our work at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/Nz2LJo0rqA\n\nAt Campano Law Group, what seems harder: selecting the AI or making a new way of working stick? I'd appreciate a quick take.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
